# Sirius: caravan contract localization
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MaterialThread-name = Open Wide Your Hand
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MaterialThread-desc = Refugees from conflict zones have arrived with rags on their backs. The Followers of the Apocalypse need thread to mend their attire.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraProduceWildBrocFlower-name = Flowers for the Needy
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraProduceWildBrocFlower-desc = The Followers of the Apocalypse need to restock their medical supplies, provide broc flowers for the overworked volunteers.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_MaterialCloth-name = Tinker, Tailor, Soldier, Spy
nc-contract-caravan_contract_MaterialCloth-desc = The State of Dayglow has a new wave of recruits ready to enter training, but they're short on material. Supply some cloth for new NCR uniforms, quickly.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraLogTimber-name = The Unfriendly North
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraLogTimber-desc = The City of Arroyo needs firewood to help keep all its citizens warm in the approaching cold season. Provide it and help the NCR care for its people.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FoodDogfood-name = Let Loose the Dogs of War
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FoodDogfood-desc = The major settlement of Junktown is training dogs for the New California Republic Army, but they're running low on dog food.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_MaterialWoodPlank1-name = Always Look on the Bright Side of Life
nc-contract-caravan_contract_MaterialWoodPlank1-desc = Caesar's Legion needs wood to construct new crucifixes for their enemies, and they have plenty of enemies. This will likely be a repeat job.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14Scraps-name = Military Industrial Complex? No, Its Quite Simple!
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14Scraps-desc = The Brotherhood of Steel intends to ramp up its efforts on confiscating dangerous technology from everyone else. They need material to feed ever-depleting ammo stockpiles.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14Scrap1-name = Recycling for Victory
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14Scrap1-desc = One of the remaining vaults from Vault-Tec needs more scrap metal to help repair damage to their water purifier tank, and will pay generously for the material.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraProduceWildCoyoteTobacco-name = Smoking out the Hive
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraProduceWildCoyoteTobacco-desc = While they normally attack on sight, the local Locust raiders are willing to deal. Provide them some coyote tobacco, and they'll let a few of our caravans pass by.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraProduceWildCannabis-name = A High Opportunity
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraProduceWildCannabis-desc = A local shaman is running dangerously low on natural cannabis and claims it is needed to hear the voices of their gods. Help keep their visions alive, and perhaps our new trading relationship will flourish.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_MisfitsFloraProduceWildKokoa-name = It's all about chocolate sometimes
nc-contract-caravan_contract_MisfitsFloraProduceWildKokoa-desc = Who doesn't like chocolate? Export some kokoa pods and they'll do the rest.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraProduceWildCarrot-name = What's Up Doc?
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraProduceWildCarrot-desc = The Followers of the Apocalypse need to feed hungry refugees from nearby conflict zones, and they are requesting wild carrots en masse.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14WeaponSniper556VarmintRifle-name = To Arms, Countrymen!
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14WeaponSniper556VarmintRifle-desc = The little settlement of Sac-Town in the NCR is expanding its molerat ranches, but that means more troopers are needed to guard the herd. Send over some rifles!
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FoodMeatRadRaw-name = You Call This Food?
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FoodMeatRadRaw-desc = The New California Republic Correctional Facility needs to feed their prisoners. Don't worry, they'll cook the meat first. Its a slight improvement.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14Weapon9mm-name = Shit Out of Luck
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14Weapon9mm-desc = A bouncer for one of the casinos in New Reno dropped his gun in the toilet. He's not about to reach in to get it, so he needs a replacement before his boss finds out.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14BrassKnife-name = Knife to Meat You!
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14BrassKnife-desc = A professional chef in New Vegas requires new knives for his kitchen staff. Pre-war tools won't do, chipped, dulled and rusted; he wants a fresh brass knife.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraProduceWildCaveFungusRad-name = Rad-Ical Science
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FloraProduceWildCaveFungusRad-desc = A rogue Vault-Tec scientist believes that research into irradiated fungus could lead to a future where America is radiation free. They are willing to pay handsomely for samples.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MaterialLeather1-name = Doing Your Patriotic Duty
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MaterialLeather1-desc = One of the vaults requires material to produce new dweller jumpsuits. Normally the caravan network doesn't deal with these fanatics, but they have caps instead of pre-war dollars this time.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobGhoulFeral-name = The Long, Violent Goodbye
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobGhoulFeral-desc = The Followers of the Apocalypse want to properly understand why ghouls go feral, and how to possibly stop or reverse it. Send them some fresh research material.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobRaiderPsycho-name = Headhunting for Profit
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobRaiderPsycho-desc = Raiders continue to be a problem, and their attacks on NCR tourists has reached a tipping point. There is now a bounty on local outlaws, until the voters are satisfied.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14DrinkNukaCola-name = Water, Water Everywhere, Not a Drop to Drink!
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14DrinkNukaCola-desc = Even with a lack of new branded merchandise for over two centuries, Nuka Cola still has die-hard loyalists. These fanatics will pay absurd amounts to the caravan network for just a bottle.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobRaiderBoss-name = California Blues
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobRaiderBoss-desc = The local raider bosses have expanded from attacking drifters and NCR settlers, and begun ambushing their rangers and soldiers. The NCR is paying a bounty on local outlaw leaders now.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobCazador-name = Pest Control
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobCazador-desc = Cazador nests continue to spread and kill the native wildlife, thin out their population and bring the caravan network proof the job was done. Pack some antidote, as well.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14SuperSledgeHammer-name = Hammer Time
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14SuperSledgeHammer-desc = The Brotherhood of Steel tend to love these hammers. When you have a hammer in your hands, everything looks like a nail. And really big nails need really big hammers. The paladins naturally, want a few more.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobDeathclaw-name = Payback, With Interest
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobDeathclaw-desc = Deathclaws have begun predating on NCR caravaneers and settlers in the region. The Rangers are now paying a generous bounty for proof of any deathclaws killed by our contractors.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobDeathclawMetal-name = Didn't Stop to Think if They Should
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobDeathclawMetal-desc = The caravan network has heard reports of armored deathclaws in the region, which would be a serious threat to our expansion efforts. Send us proof you've eliminated the issue for payment.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FoodCannedFish-name = Prepare for the Future
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FoodCannedFish-desc = Some people suspect the world might end again soon, that some maniac might get their hands on a surviving nuclear warhead and bury us all. These wastelanders want to stock up for disaster, and quickly.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FoodEggChicken-name = Eggs, Over Easy
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14FoodEggChicken-desc = In large industrial cities such as The Hub, things like fresh eggs can be hard to get. Citizens of the NCR will pay generously for clean, fresh food from the frontiers.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14Whip-name = Where There's A Whip, There's A Way!
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14Whip-desc = Legion slavemasters have broken their whips from overuse on unarmed women and children; send them replacements to continue their brave beatings of those who can't fight back.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobRadscorpion-name = Sting of the Scorpion
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobRadscorpion-desc = Radscorpions have begun getting bold and now attack the explorers of Caesar's Legion, even far afield from their nests. Remove these invasive pests and you'll be generously compensated.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobMirelurk-name = Operation Fish-in-a-Barrel
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobMirelurk-desc = Mirelurks in the region have proven to be a consistent bother to the local Brotherhood of Steel. Allied chapters with an interest in their success are paying a bounty on local mirelurks as a result.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14WeaponRifleAk112-name = Remember Helios One
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14WeaponRifleAk112-desc = A group of rogue Brotherhood of Steel knights are looking to go against orders, and honor their lost brothers of the Mojave Chapter by baptising some NCR recruits in heavy machine gun fire.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14ClothingLegionReconArmor-name = Revenge, for Charity
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14ClothingLegionReconArmor-desc = Escaped slaves of Caesar's Legion have pooled together their savings to see at least a few of their tormentors dead. Instead of taking ears, the refugees will be satisfied with this as proof instead.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14PilumSpear-name = Spears of Destiny
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14PilumSpear-desc = A collector of authentic Legion weaponry back in The Hub is looking to complete his display with a few more pilum spears. Satisfy his request and this eccentric will compensate the caravan network handsomely.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobRadMirelurk-name = Gone Fishing
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobRadMirelurk-desc = Glowing mirelurks have proven to be a nuisance to Caesar's Legion, with their shells deflecting bullets like power armor. Remove this obstacle to their explorers, and be richly rewarded.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14Gladius-name = Cut to the Marrow
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14Gladius-desc = There are disagreements among those of Caesar's Legion, and some Old Guard elements are paying quite well for proof you've eliminated 'false legion' in their eyes. Send the trophies to get paid.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14VeteranLegionArmor-name = Blood and Sand
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14VeteranLegionArmor-desc = The New California Republic is paying well for proof of dead Legion scum. Strip a set of veteran armor off a fresh corpse as evidence you finished the job, and send it in for your payment.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobDeathclawGrandHunt-name = The Bottom Line
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14MobDeathclawGrandHunt-desc = Deathclaws have attacked local merchants, leading to significant losses of trusted caravaneers. The caravan network is offering a generous reward for those who will thin out their nests.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14WeaponPlasmaRifleDelivery-name = Ad Victorium
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14WeaponPlasmaRifleDelivery-desc = The Brotherhood of Steel is paying a fortune for a functional plasma rifle in working condition. They don't care how you get it, and the caravan network agrees with the sentiment.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14VaultPDA-name = Corporate Espionage
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14VaultPDA-desc = The pip-boys from the local vault have valuable data and the demand among the caravan network's clientele is significant. We don't care if you have to saw it off their wrists, get it done.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14ChineseSword-name = People's Liberation Army
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14ChineseSword-desc = While most ghoulified remnants of the PLA or their descendents have moved on from the past or died out, some take up the banner still. A new group needs a symbol of the past to fight drifters with.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14HolotapeQuestGECK-name = Grow Me A Paradise
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14HolotapeQuestGECK-desc = OSI scientists in the City of Dayglow are interested in GECK holotape data, and are willing to pay a generous sum. They assure us the government can be trusted not to mishandle this information.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14HolotapeEnclave-name = America the Not-So Beautiful
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14HolotapeEnclave-desc = Information pulled from the cold dead hands of the Enclave is always valuable to the Brotherhood of Steel, and their representatives are interested in more data stolen from the remnants of America's elite.
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14CurrencyPrewar-name = Cash is Still King
nc-contract-caravan_contract_N14CurrencyPrewar-desc = A delusional Vault-Tec Overseer believes that pre-war currency is still valuable, and wishes to stockpile it. As long as they have caps to trade for it with the caravan network, we'll feed this fantasy.
